  "_comment": "Base values for scripts/build_economy.py. rules: first match wins. match = item id, #tag or re:<regex on the id>. value = base value before scale (0 = worthless, missing = derived from recipes). bank = category in the sell list (missing/false = can't be sold). Crafted items get the value of their cheapest recipe automatically; only give a value to things you find, mine, farm or loot.",
